            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobunok etasuro loka EJAKAIT ajakanuto kere nuka akwapin nuerimoritos Yuda, komam bobo esurokinete Yekosapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.8.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 8:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koyaut ice ka Ipilisitian ainakineta mama ejai Yekosapat, ka esolo loka epuesa; koinut Iarabun da ŋes isipanin, imerekekin ilukumin ikanykaarei ka akwat akanykaarei, ka ikorwa ilukumin ikanykaarei ka akwat akanykaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyatanakin apolou naka Yekosapat apoloor noi; koduk itogoi luegogoŋ ka ireria lukaiŋad koYuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kejaas ŋes aswamisio nuipu koreria luka Yuda; ka ikajiok, ituŋa lukirigin luetitiŋ, koYerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lo ŋes etiaikec kwape ajaatar ikekia luka lukapapaakec; luka Yuda, ikapolok luka ilukumin; Adana lokapolon, ka ituŋa lukirigin Iuetitiŋ ilukumin akwat auni nepepe kaŋes: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kotupite ŋes Yekokanan ekapolon; ka ilukumin akwat aarei ka ilukumin akaisakanykauni nepepe kaŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
