        },
        {
          "text": " Kotupite ŋes Amasia okoku loka Sikiri, loabu kijaikin ketau loejok mama ejai EJAKAIT; ka ituŋa lukirigin luetitiŋ ilukumin akwat aarei nepepe kaŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
